repository-code: "https://github.com/salomaopena/HEIAuthRisk"
url: "https://github.com/salomaopena/HEIAuthRisk"
abstract: >-
  HEIAuthRisk is a pseudonymized dataset of 73,526 successful Google Workspace
  authentication events associated with 12,190 actor pseudonyms from two higher-education
  institutions. The public schema contains 23 attributes covering authentication context,
  observed history, recent login frequency, network and geographic novelty, and the
  provider-generated provider_suspicious operational signal. The signal is not forensic
  ground truth of account compromise.
keywords:
  - Cloud identity
  - User and entity behavior analytics
  - Cybersecurity dataset
  - Suspicious login
  - Behavioral analysis
